# Stinkweed Imp: "destroy that creature" - the creature its combat damage was dealt to. Birds of Paradise blocks the Imp and
# dies of that 1 damage as a state-based action before the trigger resolves (CR 704.5g, 603.3); the trigger then finds no such
# permanent (CR 400.7) and does nothing. The Imp survives the Birds' 0 power.

